WEBVTT

00:10.450 --> 00:12.580
I caught it! That's my tenth one!

00:18.710 --> 00:20.430
What a big field mouse!

00:20.430 --> 00:22.000
It looks delicious!

00:28.560 --> 00:30.470
Mister Field Mouse, I'm sorry.

00:34.240 --> 00:36.380
Thank you for your sacrifice!

00:40.870 --> 00:42.330
That startled me!

00:43.170 --> 00:46.630
Why do you scream every time 
I dress something I catch?

00:51.500 --> 00:55.450
How did I even live in my past life?

01:08.980 --> 01:11.010
We're going to feast tonight, Sora!

01:31.110 --> 01:39.370
<b>The Weakest Tamer
Began a Journey
to Pick Up Trash</b>

02:44.020 --> 02:49.020
<b>To Latoto Village</b>

02:49.900 --> 02:54.490
I'm trying to get to a town 
near the capital of this kingdom.

02:54.890 --> 02:58.740
The fortune teller told me 
that I should go there.

02:59.760 --> 03:03.090
This is where I was born, Latomi Village.

03:03.090 --> 03:07.040
And it isn't on this map,
 but the royal capital is this way.

03:07.040 --> 03:11.100
So, first, I think I'll head 
for this town, Otolwa.

03:20.370 --> 03:22.130
That's a relief.

03:23.170 --> 03:25.830
Sora, you really are delicate, aren't you?

03:25.830 --> 03:28.610
Aren't you going to grow and get stronger?

03:32.020 --> 03:35.190
Since you're a rare slime, 
you're a complete mystery.

03:37.720 --> 03:38.530
Something's coming.

03:43.430 --> 03:45.030
Sora, slip in here.

03:49.700 --> 03:50.960
Ow!

03:51.340 --> 03:52.480
<i>No good. It's too fast!</i>

03:52.480 --> 03:53.630
<i>It's going to catch up!</i>

04:05.790 --> 04:07.180
<i>Those are Huge Ants.</i>

04:26.820 --> 04:28.370
I'm safe.

04:36.100 --> 04:39.600
In the forest, you never know 
when you'll encounter monsters,

04:39.600 --> 04:42.680
so you always have to pay attention 
to the feel of your surroundings.

04:43.600 --> 04:44.540
Huh?

04:44.540 --> 04:47.250
Sora, have you gotten a little bigger?

04:47.250 --> 04:49.730
I feel like you might be a little heavier.

04:52.070 --> 04:53.860
Maybe I'm just imagining it.

04:54.440 --> 04:57.420
I suppose it doesn't matter! Ow!

04:57.420 --> 05:00.130
I got cut by that branch earlier.

05:00.520 --> 05:03.370
I need to tend to it before it festers.

05:03.370 --> 05:04.410
Right?

05:06.030 --> 05:10.950
Let's see. Blue potion. Blue potion.

05:29.400 --> 05:32.980
With discolored potions, 
one won't be enough to heal this.

05:39.770 --> 05:41.520
Looks like I had just enough of them!

05:41.950 --> 05:45.740
But... now, I'm completely 
out of blue potions.

05:46.940 --> 05:49.810
I feel like I had a lot more than this.

05:50.190 --> 05:52.870
Sora, have you seen any potions?

05:53.410 --> 05:55.600
That's so strange.

05:56.170 --> 05:58.310
Did I drop them somewhere?

06:01.990 --> 06:04.770
The village should be close now.

06:04.770 --> 06:07.330
If I follow this road...

06:10.040 --> 06:11.620
"Wanted"?

06:11.620 --> 06:15.100
"Femicia, aged 8, born in Latomi Village."

06:15.100 --> 06:17.590
"Reward 500 dal"?!

06:17.960 --> 06:19.940
That's a huge reward.

06:19.940 --> 06:22.600
Why would they offer such a 
large sum of money for me?

06:22.920 --> 06:25.960
Huh? Because I'm a wanted fugitive?

06:26.580 --> 06:29.220
Oh, I don't like this. 
It makes me sound like a villain.

06:29.220 --> 06:32.250
Besides, I'm not Femicia anymore!

06:33.370 --> 06:35.440
I'm Ivy now.

06:38.760 --> 06:40.300
There's one over there, too!

06:41.760 --> 06:44.630
Oh, how mean!

06:46.180 --> 06:48.650
That's not what my face looks like!

06:55.020 --> 06:56.130
What's this?

06:58.460 --> 07:01.220
This one might look a bit like me.

07:01.220 --> 07:03.490
Huh? What's that pose supposed to mean?

07:05.440 --> 07:07.610
I just don't understand.

07:09.830 --> 07:13.000
Sora, people will see you, 
so come get inside this bag.

07:15.240 --> 07:19.210
I'm so glad we made it 
before it started to get dark!

07:33.560 --> 07:35.520
<i>Everyday magic.</i>

07:35.520 --> 07:37.880
<i>If only I could use it, too.</i>

07:40.940 --> 07:42.370
Wait for me!

07:46.900 --> 07:48.930
See? I won!

07:48.930 --> 07:50.180
That's no fair!

07:50.180 --> 07:52.910
You're too fast, big brother! 
You're not allowed to run!

07:53.190 --> 07:55.890
<i>That boy has a sprinting skill.</i>

07:56.370 --> 07:59.440
You're the one who has a search skill!

07:59.440 --> 08:01.640
You were just too slow finding me.

08:01.640 --> 08:02.960
What?

08:02.960 --> 08:04.780
No fighting!

08:04.780 --> 08:06.420
Behave yourselves!

08:07.670 --> 08:09.480
No, no, dear.

08:09.480 --> 08:13.280
You have an intimidation skill, so 
you have to say things more gently.

08:13.280 --> 08:17.520
You say that, but this is 
something I was born with, so...

08:18.820 --> 08:21.410
<i>I didn't know that there was 
an intimidation skill.</i>

08:21.410 --> 08:22.950
<i>That's the first time I've seen it.</i>

08:24.610 --> 08:25.980
<i>A bakery!</i>

08:27.930 --> 08:32.700
How long has it been 
since I last ate any kind of bread?

08:34.340 --> 08:35.720
A butcher's.

08:38.530 --> 08:39.540
That's right!

08:41.520 --> 08:43.880
I might be able to sell 
the meat I caught earlier!

09:00.620 --> 09:01.880
Hey, boy!

09:02.770 --> 09:04.580
Did you need something?

09:04.580 --> 09:08.190
Um, no, I...

09:09.010 --> 09:10.680
I have something to sell.

09:14.050 --> 09:14.980
What's wrong?

09:14.980 --> 09:16.350
Show me.

09:17.500 --> 09:18.350
Yes, sir!

09:21.170 --> 09:22.480
A field mouse, huh?

09:22.480 --> 09:23.350
What?

09:23.350 --> 09:27.470
I've got a two-star odor skill. 
I can tell by the smell.

09:27.790 --> 09:28.790
Now then.

09:35.240 --> 09:36.850
It's very fresh.

09:37.250 --> 09:38.850
Did you catch it yourself?

09:38.850 --> 09:42.860
Yes. I wrapped it in bana leaves 
right after dressing it.

09:42.860 --> 09:45.720
You've got experience in this. 
The butchering was done well.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.900
How many do you have?

09:53.330 --> 09:56.150
Given this amount, it would come 
to about a hundred dal.

09:56.150 --> 09:57.490
Will that do?

09:57.490 --> 09:58.800
Yes, sir!

09:58.800 --> 09:59.780
Then...

10:01.200 --> 10:03.560
Here you go, a million dal.

10:04.820 --> 10:06.710
A million?

10:06.710 --> 10:08.950
I'm joking! It's a joke!

10:11.480 --> 10:13.640
If you catch any more, bring them by.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.280
Lately, everyone's been going after big game.

10:16.280 --> 10:19.100
There aren't many guys 
who bring me field mice.

10:20.670 --> 10:21.730
Yes, sir!

10:43.580 --> 10:44.780
What will you have?

10:47.120 --> 10:49.000
I haven't seen you before.

10:49.000 --> 10:49.980
Where are you from?

10:49.980 --> 10:52.140
Um...

10:52.800 --> 10:53.860
A neighboring village?

10:53.860 --> 10:56.500
Um, yes. I have relatives here.

10:56.500 --> 10:59.220
I see. What would you like?

10:59.220 --> 11:03.430
How much can I buy with a hundred dal?

11:03.430 --> 11:07.110
What's this? You've never 
done any shopping before?

11:07.470 --> 11:11.210
With a hundred dal, you could 
take everything in that basket.

11:12.420 --> 11:14.190
Let's see.

11:15.150 --> 11:18.070
Could I have this and this, please?

11:18.380 --> 11:20.190
The two of those come to twenty dal.

11:22.710 --> 11:26.210
Here! Twenty... million dal.

11:31.060 --> 11:33.010
You're a funny boy.

11:39.810 --> 11:41.690
Here. Thank you for your business.

11:44.500 --> 11:47.260
Bread! It's bread! It's bread!

11:55.410 --> 11:57.430
Sora! It's bread!

12:01.580 --> 12:03.340
Here. This is yours, Sora.

12:06.120 --> 12:08.110
Thank you for this meal!

12:14.590 --> 12:16.150
It's so good!

12:18.330 --> 12:21.540
When was the last time I ate some?

12:21.540 --> 12:23.100
Sora, you eat, too!

12:24.300 --> 12:26.450
Huh? What's wrong?

12:26.450 --> 12:27.660
It's really good.

12:30.200 --> 12:34.820
Could it be that when you spread 
sideways, you're saying, "no"?

12:38.270 --> 12:39.950
I guess that's what it means.

12:41.090 --> 12:44.260
Then, what do disintegrating slimes eat?

12:47.280 --> 12:49.080
No, I still don't understand.

12:51.640 --> 12:53.930
I caught a huge haul of field mice!

12:53.930 --> 12:56.240
We'll be able to get money for these again!

12:57.060 --> 12:59.460
And then I'll be able to buy bread again.

13:02.760 --> 13:04.750
Oh! A dumping ground!

13:09.200 --> 13:11.840
Is there anything good here?

13:14.830 --> 13:16.110
Potions!

13:17.090 --> 13:19.080
And there are so many!

13:21.940 --> 13:24.510
But they're really badly discolored.

13:24.510 --> 13:26.970
I wonder if there are any that seem usable.

13:31.780 --> 13:33.970
This is a red potion.

13:34.830 --> 13:37.030
This is a green potion.

13:37.600 --> 13:40.800
This one is... blue? 
It's a little light, though.

13:40.800 --> 13:43.040
This is red. This is blue.

13:43.040 --> 13:44.260
This one's blue, too.

13:44.260 --> 13:45.240
Green.

13:45.610 --> 13:46.670
Blue.

13:46.670 --> 13:47.850
Red.

13:56.650 --> 13:57.980
Red.

13:57.980 --> 13:58.810
Huh?

13:59.350 --> 14:01.700
Sora, can you dispose of trash?

14:02.590 --> 14:04.050
Even the bottles dissolved!

14:04.050 --> 14:07.910
The only ones able to get rid of inorganic 
materials are high-level rare slimes, right?

14:10.190 --> 14:11.700
Then, how about this?

14:15.100 --> 14:18.280
Huh? You can't do it? It's only potions?

14:20.690 --> 14:22.140
This one should be all right, then.

14:22.140 --> 14:22.670
Here.

14:25.470 --> 14:27.800
Huh? That's not it either?

14:28.770 --> 14:31.670
What about this one? 
Is it limited to blue potions?

14:42.160 --> 14:44.550
N-No, Sora! Don't eat all of them!

14:44.550 --> 14:47.780
Please leave some for me to use! Sora!

14:48.830 --> 14:50.120
Hello!

14:50.120 --> 14:52.570
Oh! I see you've caught quite a few.

14:52.570 --> 14:56.250
Let's see. Would two hundred 
and fifty dal do?

14:56.250 --> 14:59.060
Yes, sir! Thank you!

14:59.960 --> 15:04.340
This bread, and... one of 
those sweet ones, too, please!

15:04.340 --> 15:05.830
Thank you for your business.

15:06.800 --> 15:08.850
And I'll add in this one for free.

15:11.630 --> 15:12.820
Thank you for waiting.

15:13.390 --> 15:14.810
Thank you so much!

15:22.450 --> 15:24.190
Sora, do you want to come bathing, too?

15:26.030 --> 15:27.630
I didn't think so.

15:27.630 --> 15:29.990
You seem like you'd get swept away 
before you knew it.

15:43.610 --> 15:45.130
It's so good!

15:45.700 --> 15:49.090
Getting to eat bread like this every day... 
Now, this is happiness!

15:50.890 --> 15:53.790
Staying here forever might be nice.

15:53.790 --> 15:55.430
Sora, do you think so, too?

15:56.850 --> 15:58.470
And the villagers...

15:59.650 --> 16:01.560
They're all so kind.

16:05.680 --> 16:09.550
It's nice not having to be 
afraid of people, isn't it?

16:13.180 --> 16:16.210
I wish I could stay here forever.

16:26.850 --> 16:28.170
<i>Those are adventurers.</i>

16:31.800 --> 16:33.510
What is it, kid?

16:37.890 --> 16:41.020
You have quite a few magic bags there, huh?

16:41.470 --> 16:43.160
What's inside them?

16:43.160 --> 16:44.980
Hey, why don't you show us?

16:46.060 --> 16:48.340
Come on, hurry up!

16:50.850 --> 16:52.130
He's scared.

16:52.130 --> 16:55.370
It must be because you look so evil.

16:55.370 --> 16:57.450
What did you just say, you rat?

16:57.450 --> 16:58.500
<i>It's all right.</i>

16:58.500 --> 17:00.940
<i>They haven't realized that I'm Femicia!</i>

17:05.250 --> 17:05.920
Hey, boy!

17:08.310 --> 17:09.880
Have you caught any field mice?

17:12.210 --> 17:15.330
Oh. Um, no. Not today...

17:15.890 --> 17:19.930
I see. Some adventurers have 
come to the village, you see?

17:19.930 --> 17:23.580
They bought all my dried meat, saying
 they need it for food on their travels.

17:23.580 --> 17:28.060
All my stock is gone, so if you catch any 
field mice, bring them to me, won't you?

17:28.060 --> 17:28.740
Yes, sir.

17:28.740 --> 17:30.870
I'll add a little extra 
to the purchase price for you.

17:30.870 --> 17:32.020
I'm counting on you.

17:32.020 --> 17:33.360
Y-Yes, sir.

17:40.080 --> 17:41.100
Young man!

17:42.340 --> 17:44.310
Don't you want any bread today?

17:44.310 --> 17:45.040
No.

17:45.040 --> 17:49.220
What's this? And I baked 
your favorite today, too.

17:49.220 --> 17:50.550
That's all right.

17:50.870 --> 17:51.820
Take this with you.

17:51.820 --> 17:53.550
What? But...

17:53.550 --> 17:57.290
It's all right. They'll only 
get hard if they sit here.

17:57.290 --> 18:00.550
You don't need to pay me for them. Eat them 
while they're freshly baked and delicious!

18:01.490 --> 18:02.330
Here!

18:02.330 --> 18:03.690
Th-Thank you.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.180
Young man?

18:12.180 --> 18:13.790
What's wrong?

18:16.880 --> 18:18.540
It's such a nice village!

18:20.460 --> 18:22.410
And they're all such good people!

18:24.420 --> 18:25.410
But...

18:27.020 --> 18:28.550
I can't stay here any longer.

18:37.840 --> 18:42.700
Do you think... there's a place 
for me somewhere?

18:47.490 --> 18:48.840
Sora.

18:58.310 --> 19:00.690
<i>What I need to do is get away 
from this village.</i>

19:01.100 --> 19:04.580
<i>With those wanted posters 
floating around, I can't stay here.</i>

19:16.250 --> 19:18.850
I wonder which way those men went.

19:19.600 --> 19:22.520
I have to make sure I don't go 
in the same direction.

19:24.850 --> 19:26.420
What is it, Sora?

19:27.760 --> 19:29.170
What could it be?

19:30.050 --> 19:32.380
Could it be that you're hungry?

19:33.360 --> 19:35.910
I see. So am I.

19:37.970 --> 19:40.900
I should have accepted that bread from her.

19:41.970 --> 19:45.390
I left in such a hurry, 
I didn't even draw any water.

19:45.390 --> 19:47.500
And I didn't pick up any potions.

19:48.010 --> 19:49.810
I'm sorry, Sora.

19:53.380 --> 19:56.450
Sora, are blue potions 
the only things you eat?

19:59.140 --> 20:01.540
There isn't anything else you can eat?

20:04.360 --> 20:06.860
Rare slimes are so mysterious.

20:14.290 --> 20:16.340
That's the sound of water! Let's go!

20:25.010 --> 20:26.290
It's a river!

20:31.290 --> 20:32.840
Oh! Fruit!

20:33.490 --> 20:35.460
And that's one of the delicious kinds!

20:35.860 --> 20:37.560
Sora, do you want to try eating one?

20:38.850 --> 20:41.180
You certainly are picky about food.

20:41.540 --> 20:44.390
If you don't learn to eat everything, 
you'll never get bigger!

20:45.330 --> 20:47.020
What's wrong, Sora?

21:32.970 --> 21:34.370
A potion...

21:35.940 --> 21:37.650
Right, I don't have any.

21:41.480 --> 21:42.710
Sora?

21:46.370 --> 21:48.780
Sora...

21:54.440 --> 22:00.220
<i>Oh, that's right. Slimes are monsters.</i>

22:05.730 --> 22:08.440
<i>They eat people.</i>
